，一张小木桌上还摆着几卷颜色很正的竹简，其中一卷是摊开的，洛思琦走过去看了看，上面一个字她也不认识！难道是穿越了吗？洛思琦的脑海中首先闪过的就是这个念头，再看看自己身上的衣服，还是睡前的那套衣服，原来自己昨晚想的太多，自己居然是不知不觉和衣而睡的，连鞋子也没有脱！门外的催促声还在继续，门板被拍的越来越响！洛思琦心想，既然外面那个家伙管自己叫师姐，那么暂时应该还没有什么危险，只有先见了他，才能明白自己现在所处的到底是怎么一个情况。门外那小孩一副很是不乐意的样子，他看起来不过七、八岁，这让已经有十七岁的洛思琦觉得自己显得高大成熟了许多。那小孩穿着一身很简单的粗布蓝衣，这让洛思琦有些无奈的想到“这到底是怎样一个制衣工艺极其差劲的时代啊！”她听到那个孩童说：“师姐，你怎么和师哥一样啊！叫了半天才给开门，是不是昨天在一起偷偷说情话说的太久都睡的很晚啊！”洛思琦心想怎么又冒出一个师哥啊，而且还是一个会在晚上在一起偷偷说情话的师哥？也不知道这个师哥帅不帅，有些犯花痴的洛思琦赶紧又在心里骂自己怎么这么没出息！不过这孩子在古代见到自己这样一身在现代很普通在古代却漂亮极了的衣服居然一点都不吃惊，真的让洛思琪很意外。洛思琦犯花痴的瞬间让她的小师弟再次无奈的摇了摇头，他对洛思琦说：“师姐，你该不会是和师兄商量好了今天一起来耍我的吧！你下面是不是要对我说自己睡晕了，不记得师父的房间在哪里，要我带你去？”洛思琦心想这个师兄真是帮了大忙了，自己正不知如何开口问师父的房间在哪里呢。想到这儿的洛思琦忙做诚实状狂点头，她看到那个小孩狠狠地白了她一眼，没好气的回身道：“真是的！跟我走吧！”洛思琦觉得这个小孩转身不看她的样子很有感觉，但现在不是调戏他、戏弄他的时候，她很乖的跟在这个小孩儿的身后，也没有心思去仔细看看那周围美丽的景色，经过一条小河上面的竹桥，她被带到一间稍微大一点的房子面前，那个小孩儿没好气的对她说：“师姐你自己敲门进去吧！我去准备酒菜了。”“准备酒菜？”准备酒菜做什么？难道这个不知道是谁的师父一见面就要请自己吃饭？洛思琦很想问，可是那小孩儿很快就不见了，洛思琦伸出手想留住他多问点事情，可手停在半空中还是被收回来了。她能问什么呢？她现在什么都不知道，问越多错越多，还是先见了那个所谓的师父再说吧！一想到房间里还有一个总会每晚对她说情话的师哥，很是紧张的洛思琦心中还是有了那么一丝小期待。她赶紧用手拍了一下自己的脑袋在心中骂自己“洛思琦，你到底在犯什么花痴啊？你莫名其妙的出现在这个地方，连穿越到什么朝代都不知道，居然还有心思在这里犯花痴。”小小反省过的洛思琦轻轻的敲了敲房门，她在心里对自己说：“洛思琦，你要加油！你不是看过那么多的穿越小说吗？不管到那个朝代，你都可以好好的应付的！”“进来。”房内传出一声很慈祥的回音。洛思琦有些紧张的推开门，她在心里无数次的对自己说：“要冷静！要冷静！不论发生什么洛思琦你都要冷静！”可是很快她就不冷静了，这中间也许连两秒都没有。因为她看见了她的师哥！她看见了她的师哥，就像南极上的一堆火，就像饥饿中的一碗面，就像黑暗中的一束光！他是太阳！他就是太阳！这是洛思琦现在心中唯一的念头！她的这个师哥长的很帅，真的很帅，可这都不是重点，再帅的帅哥也不能超过他给自己所带来的震撼！那一身的耐克穿在他身上显得那么的有味道！就连他脚上那双蓝色的阿迪达斯鞋都让洛思琪觉得真是帅呆了，她现在的心情是多么的舒服温暖啊！要是有人觉得洛思琦现在又在没出息的犯花痴那可是大错特错了！洛思琦虽然偶尔会为帅哥犯上那么一点小花痴，可还不会犯到现在这副张大嘴巴，眼睛快要喷出来的地步！让洛思琦如此失态的原因只有一个，那就是她的师哥，居然是唐小虾！！！这个她穿越前才刚刚在学校认识的，坐到她身后的唐小虾！！！唐小虾见到她也是愣了一下，可他只是愣了那么一下，便冲她微笑了，接着将视线转到坐在椅子上的老头身上。对他说：“这就是你要给我的惊喜？”洛思琦一时有好多话想要对唐小虾说，问他为什么也会在这里？问他这里到底是会什么地方？问他现在到底是在一个什么样的时代？可这个坐在椅子上的洛思琦到现在看到的穿着一身灰白色长袍的人，也就是她在这个时代突然冒出的师父却说话了。她听到师父对她对唐小虾说：“你们都是为师从小收留的孤儿，唐小虾入门早两个月，是唐家唯一活下来的孩子，当时还只有7岁大，洛思琪则是我替她父母收养的，来的时候只有6岁，如今十年过去了，你们已经整整十年都没有离开过这里了，你们明白了么！”洛思琦觉得这老头说话也太奇怪了，平白无故的就给自己和唐小虾安什么身份，他以为他是谁啊！上帝还是救世主啊！她转头看向唐小虾看他怎么说。她听到唐小虾对那老头说：“我说纯真，你把我忽悠到这里来到底想干什么啊！还叫我送本史记给她，说着指了指洛思琪，你把我们弄来到底有什么企图啊？”洛思琪听到那说是她师父的老头说：“我说唐小虾，像你们这样的年纪不都是有英雄梦么？都喜欢做拯救世界的英雄，你又是男孩子，有这种机会应该很兴奋才对，哪来那么多不满啊！”唐小虾一脸不屑的说道：“我可没那么多需求，我只想平平安安的，心情好吃碗兰州拉面就行，你可别在一个我都不知道是什么时代的这里给我整什么救世类的大任务，我也没那样的能力！”纯真笑道：“你怎么没有，你忘了那晚你在梦里就在地上画了条线就让愤怒的化身过不来啦！”“什么愤怒的化身？你说清楚！”唐小虾听到这个猛然间来了兴趣。洛思琪也听不明白，忙问唐小虾是怎么回事。唐小虾便把见到她之前做的那个梦说了一遍，他说本不知道怎么找她，没想到正好第二天转学就转到她的班级里了。纯真这时候笑道：“更多的话我先不说给你们了，这里马上要来一个人，我想你们一定会有兴趣见见的！”“是谁啊？”洛思琪想起那个小师弟刚说去准备酒菜，原来是这里要来客人啊！纯真很神秘的一笑：“对她说，伍子胥啊！现在你们知道这是哪个时代了吧！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 Dreaming Back to the Spring and Autumn Period and More Strange Events Luo Siqi was woken up by a knock on the door. For some reason, Luo Siqi, who always had many dreams, didn't have any dreams last night. She rubbed her eyes that had not yet been fully opened, but when her vision became clear, she suddenly froze. \"Sister! Open the door quickly! Master is calling you!\" A boy's voice urged outside. Luo Siqi pinched her arm hard. It hurt! Extremely painful! The house seemed to look like what she had seen on TV before. It was a small wooden house with an antique style. The interior was simple. There were several rolls of bamboo slips with bright colors placed on a small wooden table. One of them was open. Luo Siqi walked over and took a look. She didn't recognize a single word on it! Could it be time travel? This thought was the first thing that flashed through Luo Siqi's mind. Then he looked at the clothes he was wearing. They were still the same clothes he had worn before going to bed. It turned out that he had thought too much last night. He actually slept with his clothes on without even taking off his shoes! The urging outside the door continued, and the door panel was slapped louder and louder! Luo Siqi thought to herself that since the guy outside called her senior sister, there should be no danger for the time being. Only by meeting him first could she understand the situation she was in now. The child outside the door looked very unhappy. He looked only seven or eight years old, which made Luo Siqi, who was already seventeen years old, feel that he looked much taller and more mature. The child was wearing a simple blue coat of coarse cloth, which made Luo Siqi helplessly think, \"What kind of era is this in which the craftsmanship of clothing is extremely poor!\" She heard the child say: \"Senior sister, why are you like my senior brother? It took me a long time to open the door. Did we stay up late yesterday after talking secretly about love for too long!\" Luo Siqi thought, why did another senior brother appear, and a senior brother who secretly talked about love together at night? She didn't know whether this senior brother was handsome or not. Luo Siqi, who was a bit of a nymphomaniac, quickly cursed himself in his heart for being so worthless! However, Luo Siqi was really surprised that this child was not surprised at all when he saw him in ancient clothes, which were very common in modern times but very beautiful in ancient times. The moment Luo Siqi became infatuated, her junior brother shook his head helplessly again. He said to Luo Siqi: \"Senior sister, you and your senior brother have agreed to play tricks on me today! Are you going to tell me that you fell asleep and don't remember where the master's room is, and you want me to take you there?\" Luo Siqi thought to herself that this senior brother was really helpful, and she didn't know how to ask where the master's room was. Thinking of this, Luo Siqi nodded frantically. She saw the child give her a fierce look, turned around angrily: \"Really! Come with me!\" Luo Siqi felt that the child turned around and didn't look at her. She felt that it was very interesting, but now was not the time to tease him, so she followed the child obediently. Behind her, she didn't have the intention to take a closer look at the beautiful scenery around her. After passing a bamboo bridge over a small river, she was taken to a slightly larger house. The child said to her angrily: \"Sister, please knock on the door yourself and go in! I'm going to prepare wine and food.\" \"Prepare wine and food?\" What are you doing to prepare wine and food? Could it be that this master, who I don’t know who he is, wants to treat me to dinner as soon as I meet him? Luo Siqi wanted to ask, but the child disappeared soon. Luo Siqi stretched out her hand to keep him to ask more questions, but her hand stopped in mid-air and was withdrawn. What could she ask? She doesn't know anything now. The more she asks, the more mistakes she makes. She'd better meet the so-called master first before talking! When she thought that there was a senior brother in the room who always spoke love words to her every night, Luo Siqi, who was very nervous, still had a little expectation in her heart. She quickly slapped her head with her hand and scolded herself in her mind, \"Luo Siqi, what kind of nymphomaniac are you committing? You appeared in this place inexplicably. You don't even know what dynasty you traveled to, but you still have the intention to be a nymphomaniac here.\" After a little reflection, Luo Siqi knocked on the door gently, and said to herself in her heart: \"Luo Siqi, come on! Haven't you read so many time-travel novels? No matter which dynasty you are in, you can handle it well!\" \"Come in.\" A very kind echo came from the room. Luo Siqi opened the door nervously. She said to herself countless times in her heart: \"Calm down! Calm down! No matter what happens, Luo Siqi, you have to calm down!\" But soon she lost her composure, maybe even for two seconds. Because she saw her senior brother! She saw her senior brother, like a fire on the Antarctic, like a bowl of noodles in hunger, like a beam of light in the darkness! He is the sun! He is the sun! This is the only thought in Luo Siqi's mind now! Her senior brother is very handsome, really handsome, but that's not the point. No matter how handsome the guy is, he can't exceed the shock he brings to her! That Nike outfit looks so classy on him! Even the blue Adidas shoes on his feet made Luo Siqi feel so handsome. How comfortable and warm she felt now! If anyone thinks that Luo Siqi is now a hopeless nymphomaniac, they are totally wrong! Although Luo Siqi occasionally becomes a little bit obsessed with handsome guys, she never gets to the point where her mouth is wide open and her eyes are about to squirt out! There is only one reason why Luo Siqi is so gloomy, and that is her senior brother, who is actually Tang Xiaoxia! ! ! This was Tang Xiaoxia who she had just met at school before she traveled through time, sitting behind her! ! ! Tang Xiaoxia was stunned for a moment when he saw her, but he was just stunned for a moment, then smiled at her, and then turned his attention to the old man sitting on the chair. Said to him: \"Is this the surprise you want to give me?\" Luo Siqi had a lot to say at the time", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}